cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this code, please cite the paper and this repository."
type: software
title: "rs-counterexample: Lean verification of Counterexamples to the Reiner–Shimozono conjecture and the failure of Schubert filtrations"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of R. Hodges, "Counterexamples to the Reiner-Shimozono
  conjecture and the failure of Schubert filtrations": the coefficient formula
  for the full counterexample family, its exact negativity criterion and an
  explicit negative coefficient in 28 variables (Theorem 1.1); the failure of
  relative Schubert filtrations and of Schubert filtrations in Polo's sense
  (Corollary 1.2); the failure of Lascoux-atom positivity (Corollary 1.3); the
  quiver-theoretic results of Theorems 1.4 and 5.3 and Corollary 1.5. The
  standard results used for them are proved in three accompanying libraries:
  representations of general linear groups and their Levi subgroups,
  polynomial-time rational feasibility of linear inequalities, and the
  saturation of semi-invariants of quivers.
authors:
  - family-names: Hodges
    given-names: Reuven
version: "2.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rhodges-math/rs-counterexample"
